The business supplies and services a range of home medical equipment, including oxygen systems, power wheelchairs, CPAP and BiPAP devices, nebulizers, manual wheelchairs, hospital beds, bedside commodes, shower chairs, and walkers.

The company focuses on the durable medical equipment segment of the healthcare industry.

