UPDATE companies SET description='Affordable Furniture Manufacturing, Inc. commenced operations in 2004 in Houlka, Mississippi, as a privately owned domestic supplier specializing in promotional upholstered furniture. The company was established with a focus on becoming a true low-cost producer while maintaining quality at a very reasonable price through manufacturing efficiencies.

The business now operates over 600,000 square feet of manufacturing facilities in Houlka and employs more than 300 dedicated workers. Its extensive product offering includes stationary upholstery, motion upholstery, leather upholstery, recliners, sleepers, sectionals, sofas, loveseats, chairs, ottomans, chaises, accent pieces, and tables. By maintaining finished goods inventory on every item, the company ships orders immediately from stock.

Affordable Furniture serves the furniture industry, supplying dealers who sell to end consumers. The trade recognizes the company as a customer-oriented, low-cost leader in stationary upholstery, motion upholstery, and recliners.

