UPDATE companies SET description='Affordable Metal Manufacturing operates from Muscatine, Iowa, where Billy and Brooke Wagler own and run the family-owned business. The company distributes roll-formed metal roofing and siding products across the Midwest, guided by a mission to further the Kingdom of God through its daily work and customer relationships.

The company roll-forms standing seam panels (in 1-, 1.5-, and 1.75-inch snap-lock profiles), PBR panels, Smart Rib Plus®, and board-and-batten steel siding, all cut to length on site. It also supplies trim and accessories for residential, commercial, and agricultural projects. The shop team, led by Maisy Howell, handles production while a sales and logistics crew coordinates pickup and delivery for contractors throughout Iowa and surrounding states.

Customers include residential builders, commercial contractors such as Miles Construction and Ken Morrison Construction, and agricultural operators needing durable roofing for farm buildings. Smith Building, another commercial client, cites the firm''s fast turnaround and willingness to handle orders of any size.

AMM emphasizes American-made materials, a lifetime warranty, and short lead times as differentiators. Its stated values—integrity, trust, second chances, personal growth, relationships, and teamwork—frame a culture that aims to move at the “speed of trust” while providing expert advice and local support.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Roll forming", "Cut-to-length processing", "Metal roofing panel fabrication", "Metal siding panel fabrication", "Trim and accessory production", "Local delivery", "Customer pickup", "Technical consultation"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Agricultural construction"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Roll-formed on-site, cut-to-length panels", "Lifetime warranty on roofing and siding products", "Short lead times with fast, accurate order turnaround", "American-made materials", "Family-owned, local pickup and delivery"], "facts_used": ["Location: Muscatine, Iowa -> db", "Owners: Billy Wagler and Brooke Wagler -> /about", "Family-owned -> / (testimonial)", "Products: standing seam, PBR panel, Smart Rib Plus, board & batten -> /", "Markets: residential, commercial, agricultural -> /", "Customers: Miles Construction, Smith Building, Ken Morrison Construction -> /", "Mission: further Kingdom of God -> /about", "Values: integrity, trust, second chances, personal growth, relationships, teamwork -> /about", "Team members listed -> /about", "Lifetime warranty -> /", "Short lead times -> /", "American made -> /", "Local pickup and delivery -> /", "No order too big or small -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Metal roofing, siding, trim, and accessories, cut-to-length, roll-formed on-site", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='affordable-metal-manufacturing' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='AgaMatrix is based in Derry, New Hampshire. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed on its website. The business presents itself as a provider of diabetes care technology, focusing on engineered accuracy for medication management, GLP-1 therapy, and continuous glucose monitor (CGM) confirmation.

The company offers a range of diabetes testing supplies sold directly through its website. Its product line includes glucose meters such as the Presto and the Bluetooth-enabled Jazz Wireless 2, along with test strips, control solutions, and lancing devices with lancets. The Jazz Wireless 2 meter connects to the AgaMatrix Diabetes Manager mobile application for data tracking. No details about manufacturing processes, facility size, headcount, or production volumes are provided.

