UPDATE companies SET description='Ajinomoto Foods North America operates from Portland, Oregon, as the North American arm of the global Ajinomoto Group. The company traces its roots to the group''s founding over a century ago with a mission to solve social issues through food, and it became the first to bring frozen potstickers and breaded mozzarella sticks to market.

The company produces a wide range of ethnic frozen appetizers—Asian, Mexican, and American styles—across multiple facilities including plants in Portland, Toluca, and Fort Worth. Its manufacturing process emphasizes hand-selected ingredients from qualified suppliers, in-house cooking and assembly, and a sensory evaluation program called Descriptive Analysis that uses trained panelists to assess appearance, texture, aroma, and flavor. Continuous improvement is driven by Kaizen practices, including equipment checklists and regular inspections.

Products reach customers through foodservice, grocery, warehouse club, and custom manufacturing channels.

Ajinomoto Foods North America differentiates itself through its "Eat Well. Live Well." philosophy, a commitment to ingredient quality verified by annual supplier audits, and safety innovations such as the iWarehouse forklift monitoring system deployed at its Fort Worth location. Environmental initiatives, including carbon-reduction projects at several sites, reflect its stated focus on sustainability.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Frozen food manufacturing", "Custom manufacturing", "Sensory evaluation (Descriptive Analysis)", "Kaizen continuous improvement", "Supplier quality audits", "Forklift safety monitoring (iWarehouse)", "Hand-picked ingredient selection", "Cooking and assembly", "Manual defect removal"], "industries": ["Foodservice", "Grocery", "Warehouse club", "Custom manufacturing", "Ethnic frozen foods", "Appetizers"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["iWarehouse forklift monitoring system"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["First to market frozen potstickers and breaded mozzarella sticks", "Kaizen continuous improvement philosophy across all facilities", "Descriptive Analysis sensory panel at Toluca plant for product evaluation", "iWarehouse forklift monitoring system at Fort Worth for safety", "Annual supplier audits and hand-picked ingredient verification"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Portland, Oregon -> db", "First to market frozen potstickers and breaded mozzarella sticks -> /about-us", "Eat Well. Live Well. philosophy for over 100 years -> /about-us", "Multiple facilities: Portland, Toluca, Fort Worth -> /quality", "Kaizen continuous improvement practices -> /quality", "Descriptive Analysis (DA) sensory panel at Toluca plant -> /quality", "iWarehouse forklift monitoring at Fort Worth -> /quality", "Annual supplier inspections and hand-picked ingredients -> /quality", "Distribution channels: foodservice, grocery, warehouse club, custom manufacturing -> /", "Core values: Quality, Innovat