UPDATE companies SET description='Capital Embroidery has provided embroidery services in Juneau, Alaska, for over a decade. The business has operated from several locations—downtown, then Lemon Creek—before settling in the Mendenhall Mall. Current owner Shane Walker expanded the operation to include a retail arm, Alaskan Outdoor Wearhouse & Embroidery (AOWE), which sells outdoor apparel and gear alongside the embellishment services.

