UPDATE companies SET description='Alba Energy of Katy operates from its office in Katy, Texas. The company is part of a broader network with locations in Austin, Dallas, Houston, McAllen, and San Antonio, serving the greater Houston area including Brookshire, Sugar Land, and surrounding communities. No founding year or ownership details are publicly disclosed.

