UPDATE companies SET description='Altitude Steel Structures operates from South Salt Lake City, Utah. The company has been in business for 2.5 years, though a specific founding year is not disclosed. Ownership details and founder names are not publicly stated. The business began with a focus on providing custom steel buildings through an online 3D design tool that allows customers to configure structures before purchase.

The company designs, engineers, fabricates, and installs custom steel buildings including carports, storage buildings, workshops, and agricultural structures. All services—structural engineering, foundation work, fabrication, delivery, and installation—are performed in-house. To date, Altitude has completed over 200 buildings across Utah, Idaho, and Colorado. The structures use coated galvanized steel and Sherwin Williams paint finishes.

Customers range from general contractors and small business owners to residential homeowners. A general contractor chose Altitude for a storage facility after comparing wood and steel options. A sprinkler business owner needed a 30-by-50-foot shop for equipment storage. Other projects include custom detached garages with windows and vents, a metal building praised by a building inspector, and a garage converted from architect drawings. Installations are typically completed in one to two days.

Altitude differentiates itself with a fully integrated in-house process, 100 percent U.S.-sourced steel components, and warranties covering workmanship for one year, steel components for 20 years, and paint for 20 years. Contractors are fully licensed and meet local and international safety standards. A free online 3D builder lets clients customize every detail and request quotes instantly.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Steel building design and consultation", "Custom steel building fabrication", "Structural engineering and plans", "Foundation work", "Steel building delivery", "Professional installation", "Customization options (designs, finishes, colors)", "Carport design and consultation"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Agricultural structures", "Storage buildings", "Workshops"], "materials": ["Coated galvanized steel", "Sherwin Williams paint"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house engineering, foundation, fabrication, delivery, and installation", "100% U.S.-sourced steel components", "1-year workmanship, 20-year steel, and 20-year paint warranties", "Free online 3D building designer for instant customization and quoting", "Licensed contractors meeting local and international safety certifications"], "facts_used": ["Company located at 3513 South 300 West, South Salt Lake City, UT 84115 -> /about", "Offers custom steel buildings, carports, storage buildings, workshops, agricultural structures -> /about, /services", "Provides in-house engineering, foundation work, fabrication, delivery, and installation -> /about", "200+ steel buildings built, serving Utah, Idaho, Colorado, 2.5 years in business -> /about", "100% US steel components -> /about", "Warranties: 1-year workmanship, 20-year steel component, 20-year Sherwin Williams paint -> /about", "Free online 3D building designer -> /", "Licensed contractors meeting local and international safety certifications -> /about", "Materials: coated galvanized steel, Sherwin Williams paint -> /services, /about", "Testimonials indicate manufacturing and installation of own product, installation in 1-2 days -> /", "Customer examples: general contractor, sprinkler business owner, homeowners -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Altitude Steel made the most sense in the fact they manufacture and install their own product.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='altitude-steel-structures' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Altium Packaging operates from Janesville, Wisconsin, with a corporate office in Atlanta, Georgia. The company traces its roots back over a century of innovation in plastic packaging, though a specific founding year is not disclosed.

The company manufactures rigid plastic containers, bottles, caps, closures, and liner solutions for a wide range of markets. Its proprietary Dura-Lite® lightweighting technology reduces resin use by 5 to 32 percent while maintaining top-load strength and drop performance. Altium runs a network of more than 65 plants across the United States and Canada, staffed by nearly 4,000 employees, and operates an in-house design studio, Studio PKG™, that develops custom packaging with PCR resin options.

Altium serves the dairy, water, beverage, food, nutrition, household chemicals, specialty chemicals, automotive, personal care, and healthcare sectors. In healthcare, its Altium Healthcare line supplies containers and closures for prescription, over-the-counter, and wellness products with child- and senior-resistant features. Customers include brand owners seeking stock or custom rigid plastic packaging.

The company emphasizes a customer-centric model built on personalized service, dependability, flexibility, and creativity. It highlights sustainability practices, long-term partnerships, and its "Always Made Right®" commitment as core differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Rigid plastic container manufacturing", "Plastic bottle production", "Cap and closure manufacturing", "Liner solutions", "Lightweighting (Dura-Lite\u00ae technology)", "Custom packaging design (Studio PKG\u2122)", "PCR resin processing", "Child-resistant and senior-resistant packaging", "Stock bottle portfolio", "Sustainable packaging solutions"], "industries": ["Dairy", "Water", "Beverage", "Food", "Nutrition", "Household Chemicals", "Specialty Chemicals", "Automotive", "Personal Care", "Healthcare"], "materials": ["PCR resin", "rigid plastic", "plastic"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Network of 65+ plants in the U.S. and Canada", "Nearly 4,000 dedicated employees", "100 years of innovation in plastic packaging", "Dura-Lite\u00ae lightweighting technology using 5\u201332% less resin", "Studio PKG\u2122 in-house design center with PCR resin options"], "facts_used": ["HQ city/state: Janesville, Wisconsin -> db", "Corporate address: Atlanta, GA -> /", "65+ plants in US and Canada -> /", "Nearly 4,000 employees -> /", "100 years of innovation -> /", "Dura-Lite lightweighting technology (5-32% less resin) -> /", "Studio PKG design center -> /", "PCR resin options -> /", "Industries served: Dairy, Water, Beverage, Food, Nutrition, Household Chemicals, Specialty Chemicals, Automotive, Personal Care, Healthcare -> /", "Altium Healthcare line for prescription/OTC/wellness with child/senior safety -> /", "Languages: English, Fran\u00e7ais, Espa\u00f1ol -> /", "LinkedIn URL -> db", "Company type: Manufacturer -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Packaging Manufacturer & Plastic Container Design", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "nearly 4,000", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": ["English", "Fran\u00e7ais", "Espa\u00f1ol"], "social_links": ["https://www.linkedin.com/company/altium-packaging/"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='altium-packaging' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Aly Packaging USA operates from New York, New York, as the U.S. arm of a packaging business that began in 2013 in Croydon, England. The company originated as an endeavor of Crushing Mart Ltd., a UK-based firm that spent over a decade serving British SMEs and corporations before expanding across the Atlantic. No individual founders are named in public materials.

The company manufactures custom packaging boxes across more than 80 categories, including cardboard, kraft, corrugated, and rigid constructions. It offers printing and finishing services such as foil stamping (gold, silver, holographic), spot UV, embossing, debossing, and soft-touch coating. Box styles range from tuck and sleeve to window and handle designs. The firm reports serving over a thousand brands and maintaining near-perfect delivery across thousands of orders, with countrywide distribution from its U.S. facility.

Aly Packaging serves startups, small-to-midsize enterprises, and corporate brands across what it describes as 250-plus industries.

The company emphasizes free design support, free consultancy, and free shipping as core differentiators. It also offers prototype samples before full production and rush manufacturing options that can deliver in as few as six business days. The stated mission is to transform packaging into a growth-ready brand asset rather than mere product protection.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom packaging design", "Printing (cardboard, kraft, corrugated, rigid)", "Foil stamping (gold, silver, holographic)", "Spot UV coating", "Embossing", "Debossing", "Soft-touch coating", "Cardboard surface coating", "Rush production", "Prototype sampling", "Free design support", "Free consultancy", "Box style engineering (tuck, sleeve, window, handle)", "Eco-friendly packaging options", "Rigid box manufacturing", "Gift and food packaging"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Cardboard", "Kraft", "Corrugated", "Rigid board"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "10\u201312 business days for cardboard, kraft, and corrugated boxes; 14\u201316 business days for custom rigid boxes; rush manufacturing within 6 business days", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Free design support and consultancy", "Free nationwide shipping", "Rush production in 6 business days", "Prototype samples before mass production", "Over 80 packaging categories"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2013 in Croydon, England -> /about-us", "Headquarters New York, NY -> db", "Subsidiary of Crushing Mart Ltd. -> /about-us", "Over 80 packaging categories -> /", "Materials: cardboard, kraft, corrugated, rigid -> /", "Finishing: foil stamping, spot UV, embossing, debossing, soft-touch coating -> /", "Free design support, free consultancy, free shipping -> /", "Turnaround times: 10-12 days (cardboard), 14-16 days (rigid), rush 6 days -> /", "Prototype samples before mass production -> /", "Serves startups, SMEs, corporate brands -> /about-us", "Over 250 industries served -> /about-us", "Near-perfect deli