UPDATE companies SET description='American Solar Power operates from two Utah offices in South Jordan and Moab, serving the entire state. The company is family-owned and led by a father-son team: Kevin, an electrical engineer and master electrician, and Andrew, a licensed electrician. They began designing and installing solar systems in Utah over a decade ago, building a business around residential and commercial photovoltaic projects.

