UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1989 in Cascade, Iowa, American-Iowa Manufacturing Inc. (A.I.M.) began as a supplier to the golf and turf maintenance industry. The company operates from a 74,200-square-foot facility that includes 4,200 square feet of office and engineering space.

